#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# is_finite_field_element

#% text
# `is_finite_field_element(a)` gives `true` when `a` is an element of a finite field, and `false` otherwise.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# An integer is not a finite field element, even though it combines with them.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
is_finite_field_element(finite_field(5, 2)(7))
#% output
#= true

#% cell
is_finite_field_element(7)
#% output
#= false

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `finite_field_element`, `finite_field`
